{
  "description": "ProtectionContainer is polymorphic on containerType (AzureStorageContainer, AzureVMAppContainerProtectionContainer, ...); the converted model keeps only base members, so S.Struct strips sourceResourceId and acquireStorageAccountLock and a storage account cannot be registered. Add the subtype members to the input and output shapes.",
  "patches": [
